{"id":"wb-1-2","name":"金田起义地址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"金田起义地址","text":"金田起义地址位于中国广西自治区桂平市金田乡金田村犀牛岭。\n其北端为长方形营盘。南北长65米，东西宽35.5米，高3.6米，底厚1.8米，顶厚1.8米。面积约2,527平方米，中央建拜旗石。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%87%91%E7%94%B0%E8%B5%B7%E4%B9%89%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80","revisionId":92402619,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92402619","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":null}